			"Message": "docs(Output): Add GitHub badge badges and restore funding logo table\n\nAdd a header badge table showing last-commit, issues, stars, and downloads for quick repository status at a glance. Replace the previous inline SVG footer with an HTML table of properly sized logo images (Land, PlayForm, NLnet, NGI0 Commons Fund) linking to their respective sites.\n\nRe-wrap long lines throughout the document to improve readability without diff noise in future changes. Tighten dashes in em dash contexts and align table formatting with plain pipe-delimited syntax for cleaner markdown.\n\nThe README now provides immediate repository metadata on open and restores visually recognizable partner logos in the funding section.",
			"SHA": "f22c8b44525a362f2770c012395f615e2692f5af"
		},
		{
			"Author": "Nikola Hristov",
			"Date": "2026-06-12T00:05:54Z",
			"File": [
				"⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀",
				768,
				1
			],
			"Message": "docs(Output): Rewrite README with concise structure and inline SVG footer\n\nStrip decorative HTML tables, excess emoji formatting, and verbose component breakdowns from the README. Consolidate sections into a clearer hierarchy — Overview, Architecture (Mermaid diagram), Key Components (markdown table), In the Land Project (contextual description), Getting Started, API Reference, and Funding/acknowledgements.\n\nReplace the multi-image HTML table footer with compact inline SVG logo links for Land, PlayForm, NLnet, and NGI0. Update LICENSE link to /blob/ path for direct file access. Remove redundant \"Deep Dive,\" \"See Also,\" and \"Changelog\" sections that duplicated information now captured in the simplified structure.\n\nThe result is a leaner, more maintainable document that reads cleanly both on GitHub and npm.",
			"SHA": "5be45216b8268449f2528386a0c5b8bfc52006a9"
		},
